    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/64e43985fbeab06d227f47ff5bc2aa65.poster.avif?t=1751850489\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/64e43985fbeab06d227f47ff5bc2aa65.webm?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/64e43985fbeab06d227f47ff5bc2aa65.mp4?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown world, brutal rules, and you only have a slot machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the wheel, win rewards, face continuous challenges, improve yourself, become the god of slot machines, and create miracles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/d14f5c04df50f2b4e774c5b6338f5282.poster.avif?t=1751850489\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/d14f5c04df50f2b4e774c5b6338f5282.webm?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/d14f5c04df50f2b4e774c5b6338f5282.mp4?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dreamlike slot machine journey\u2014challenging the impossible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of talents, unique skills, blessings from the gambling gods, combined with a touch of luck in the spin, you will ultimately surpass the limits and achieve victory!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/ad08e3190ec11ca24d577ab24959f398.avif?t=1751850489\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beginner\u2019s tip: Always have one skill ready for emergencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/70bcebaa9dca14494bba4b12845e9562.poster.avif?t=1751850489\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/70bcebaa9dca14494bba4b12845e9562.webm?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/70bcebaa9dca14494bba4b12845e9562.mp4?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/64e43985fbeab06d227f47ff5bc2aa65.poster.avif?t=1751850489\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/64e43985fbeab06d227f47ff5bc2aa65.webm?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/64e43985fbeab06d227f47ff5bc2aa65.mp4?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown world, brutal rules, and you only have a slot machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the wheel, win rewards, face continuous challenges, improve yourself, become the god of slot machines, and create miracles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/d14f5c04df50f2b4e774c5b6338f5282.poster.avif?t=1751850489\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/d14f5c04df50f2b4e774c5b6338f5282.webm?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/d14f5c04df50f2b4e774c5b6338f5282.mp4?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dreamlike slot machine journey\u2014challenging the impossible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of talents, unique skills, blessings from the gambling gods, combined with a touch of luck in the spin, you will ultimately surpass the limits and achieve victory!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/ad08e3190ec11ca24d577ab24959f398.avif?t=1751850489\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beginner\u2019s tip: Always have one skill ready for emergencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/70bcebaa9dca14494bba4b12845e9562.poster.avif?t=1751850489\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/70bcebaa9dca14494bba4b12845e9562.webm?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586460/extras/70bcebaa9dca14494bba4b12845e9562.mp4?t=1751850489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
